; Stage 15 W4b sibling sweep (design/stage15-stress-test/diagnostics.md
; §W4b): before the fix, a bare colon-typed error name ("MyErr:i32") sailed
; past `emit-deferror`'s `!= NODE-SYM` check unchanged and registered the Err
; constant under that literal, unlookupable key -- compiling with NO
; diagnostic at the definition; the use site then failed as an unrelated
; "undefined: MyErr". Now rejected at the `deferror` line.
(deferror MyErr:i32 "bad")

(defn main ():!i32 (return (err! MyErr)))
